\item \points{1b} \textbf{Softmax Computation}

Given logits $\mathbf{z} = [2.0, 1.0, -1.0]$ for the three classes [Joy, Anger, Fear], compute the softmax probabilities. Show your work.

\expect{Return the softmax probability vector $[P(\text{Joy}), P(\text{Anger}), P(\text{Fear})]$ with values rounded to 3 decimal places.}

